				</attack>
			</attacks>
			<backstory><![CDATA[You are a survivor of the slave blocks of Darkspine on Avernus, or Dis, the Iron City, having managed to escape your servitude as a slave. You know how to pick a lock, hide and scrounge, surviving on the barest minimum to get by in the blasted landscape of Hell and the back alleys of its hateful cities. You know how to spot a slaver, and have a finely tuned will to live.]]></backstory>
